Polish pass against critique: hero, wordmark, chrome, section variety

Direct response to the punch list:

Hero typesetting
- Drop the staircase indent and the gold dimension-tick band-aid.
- Flush-left all three lines: "An archive / for the things / you keep."
- Type size pushed (clamp 3.4-10.4rem), line-height tightened to 0.86,
  letter-spacing to -0.05em, Fraunces opsz pinned at 144.
- Italic "keep." carries the only emphasis.

Wordmark
- Remove the italic-a kerning trick. The "Artif<b>a</b>cts" pattern
  is gone from both nav and footer.
- Custom surveyor's-transit crosshair mark sits left of the wordmark
  in the same vocabulary as the photographic registration marks.
- Mark rotates 45 degrees on brand hover.

Header chrome
- Two bars at rest. The hero-top three-cell meta strip is gone; that
  data folds into the hero kicker row inline with the accession label.
- Reserve nav CTA is now outline-style (gold dot + transparent bg).
  It fills with gold only on hover, so it stops competing with every
  headline as you scroll.

Section variety, breaking the recipe
- Catalogue: hanging headline + ink CTA on the left, six-unit scale
  diagram on a 1ft grid on the right, full-width ledger below.
- FeatureBoatRV: full-bleed photographic plate with headline overlaid
  bottom-left over a gradient scrim, four-cell horizontal spec strip
  below, centered CTA at the bottom.
- ReserveSection: dense availability ledger inside the widget showing
  six unit-size cells per facility with state indicators (Available /
  1 left / Waitlist) plus a meta header row (Facility / Open Sizes /
  From). Procedure ledger reshaped to numbered title + monocaps body,
  with a Margin Note annotation below filling the prior dead space.

Dead space
- Manifesto: standing-policy stamp at the bottom of the statement
  column (filed/last-revised/posted dates + circular SVG wax seal).
- Catalogue: scale diagram fills the prior right-column emptiness.
- Reserve: availability ledger + margin note + facility CTA fill both
  columns to the same height.

Background grid
- One system. Drop the FieldNote-specific ::before/::after edge ticks;
  the body blueprint grid is the single source of truth.

Production polish
- devIndicators: false in next.config.ts so the harness no longer
  shows the "N" in the bottom-left.
- Tabular numerics on every metadata value.
- React 19 set-state-in-effect lint clean.

Acknowledged outside-resource gaps
- A commissioned custom logotype is out of scope; the crosshair-mark
  approach is the in-code equivalent.
- Art-directed photography needs a photographer and facility access;
  the existing Storedge CDN photo set is being used more confidently
  (full-bleed Boat & RV plate) but not expanded.
